    "i18n/zh-demo.js", "demo.exdb.p", "exam", "", "A made-up exam room, DEMO, with 12 seats and 18 sample flags. The sample invigilator has already checked 15 of them and pressed \"flag was right\" or \"flag was wrong\", so the precision-per-signal table is already filled (8 right out of 15 in total). 3 flags are still in the queue for you to mark yourself. These numbers only show how the tally works; they are not a measured accuracy of LENSIQ, which has not been measured in a real exam room. The invigilator always decides.", "虚构的考场 DEMO，12 个座位，18 条示例提醒。示例监考老师已检查其中 15 条，并按下“提醒正确”或“提醒错误”，因此各信号的准确率表已有数据（合计 15 条中 8 条正确）。队列中还有 3 条供您自己标记。这些数字仅用于演示统计方式，并非 LENSIQ 实测的准确率，真实考场尚未测量。最终由监考老师判断。", "",
