    "i18n/zh-gate-village.js", "vg.q.auto", "gate", "", "Open the barrier automatically for resident vehicles whose plate matches exactly? Pass the on-site accuracy check first and always keep a guard at the post", "为车牌完全一致的住户车辆自动开闸？请先通过现场准确率检查，并始终有门卫值守", "",
