    "i18n/zh-gate.js", "gk.chk.intro", "gate", "", "During the check, every time the system suggests a plate, staff press ✓ Read correctly or ✗ Read wrongly (or correct the number and confirm, which counts as ✗). The system calculates whole-plate and per-character accuracy, split into day and night, with 95% confidence intervals.", "检查期间，系统每次给出车牌建议时，工作人员按 ✓ 识别正确 或 ✗ 识别错误（或修改号码后确认，计为 ✗）。系统计算整牌与逐字准确率，并按白天/夜间分开，附 95% 置信区间。", "",
    "i18n/zh-insights.js", "iq.acc.note", "store", "", "“Pass (confirmed)” = the whole 95% confidence interval meets the target at that site · Results are stored in each device's browser; this page shows this device only · Re-run the check on that camera's page after moving it or when the lighting changes", "“通过（已确认）”= 整个 95% 置信区间都达到该现场的目标 · 检查结果保存在各设备的浏览器中，本页只显示本设备 · 移动摄像头或光照改变后请在该摄像头页面重新检查", "",
    "i18n/zh-insights.js", "iq.rep.methods", "store", "", "Methods: daily counts compared with negative binomial + AR(1) serial error · rates with Wilson / quasi-binomial · A/B tested jointly first, then all pairs (Holm) · multiple comparisons adjusted with Benjamini–Hochberg · correlation is not evidence of cause and effect", "计算方法：每日计数用负二项模型 + AR(1) 持续误差比较 · 比率用 Wilson / quasi-binomial · A/B 先整体检验再比较所有配对（Holm）· 同时查看多项时用 Benjamini–Hochberg 校正 · 相关不代表因果", "",
    "i18n/zh-insights.js", "iq.fn.over", "store", "", "{p}% of the previous step (may be counted more than once, so no confidence interval)", "上一步的 {p}%（可重复计数，因此不计算置信区间）", "",
    "i18n/zh-insights.js", "iq.ab.sg.v", "store", "", "Top-ranked “{b}” differs from the last-ranked by {d} pts (simultaneous 95% interval: {lo} to {hi}) · {c} · all ads tested jointly first ({m}), then all {k} pairs compared with the Holm correction · solid dot = raw value, line = 95% interval (Wilson), tick = value adjusted for sample size", "第一名“{b}”与最后一名相差 {d} 个百分点（联合 95% 区间：{lo} 到 {hi}）· {c} · 先对所有广告做整体检验（{m}），再比较全部 {k} 对并用 Holm 校正 · 实心点 = 原始值，线 = 95% 区间（Wilson），竖线 = 按数据量调整后的值", "",
    "i18n/zh-interview.js", "iv.c.drive.sit", "hr", "", "Halfway through the quarter you see you will fall 30% short of target. What would you do?", "季度过半时你发现会比目标少 30%，你会做些什么", "",
    "i18n/zh-interview.js", "iv.c.persuade.sit", "hr", "", "A client says your price is 15% higher than a competitor's. How would you respond?", "客户说你的价格比竞争对手贵 15%，你会怎么回答", "",
    "i18n/zh-interview.js", "iv.js.sci", "hr", "", "Scientific limits: gestures and facial movements do not reliably reveal inner emotions and differ between people and cultures (Barrett et al., 2019); people tell true from untrue statements correctly only about 54% of the time, close to chance (Bond & DePaulo, 2006)", "科学局限：手势和面部动作并不能可靠地反映内在情绪，且因人因文化而异（Barrett 等，2019）；人们分辨真话与假话的正确率只有约 54%，接近随机猜测（Bond & DePaulo，2006）", "",
    "i18n/zh-med.js", "md.pc.ad.source", "product-check", "", "Experimental: the measured accuracy is shown in the panel above. Differently worded claims may be missed", "实验性功能：实测准确度见上方面板。措辞不同的宣称可能被遗漏", "",
    "i18n/zh-photobooth.js", "photobooth.js.sheet.foot", "studio", "", "{size} × {n} photos · 300 DPI · Print at 100% actual size (no scaling)", "{size} × {n} 张 · 300 DPI · 请按 100% 实际尺寸打印（勿缩放）", "",
    "i18n/zh-photobooth.js", "photobooth.js.rv.spec.headBad", "studio", "", "Head is {p}% of the photo height, outside the usual 50–75%", "头部占照片高度 {p}%，超出常见的 50–75%", "",
    "i18n/zh-products.js", "pd.r.doc.desc", "store", "", "Count shop visitors, estimate conversion, get daily summaries and combine branches with the cameras you already have. Processed on the device, no images kept, measured accuracy published", "用现有摄像头统计进店人数、估算成交率、每日汇总并合并多门店数据。在设备上处理，不保存图像，公开实测准确度", "",
    "i18n/zh-studio.js", "studio.js.id.topBad", "studio", "", "Space above the head is {p}% (should be 3–20%); the head may be cut off", "头顶上方留白为 {p}%（应为 3–20%），头部可能被裁切", "",
    "i18n/zh-studio.js", "studio.js.id.icao", "studio", "", "ICAO-style passport photos (3.5×4.5 cm) need the head at 71–80% of the photo height, unlike usual ID photos", "ICAO 标准护照照片（3.5×4.5 厘米）要求头部占照片高度的 71–80%，与一般证件照不同", "",
    "i18n/zh-zones.js", "zc.log.prec", "zones", "", "Precision of checked alerts {p}% ({tp}/{n}) · 95% confidence interval {lo}–{hi}% · waiting for a check {open}", "已核实提醒的准确率 {p}%（{tp}/{n}）· 95% 置信区间 {lo}–{hi}% · 待核实 {open}", "",
    "attendance.js", "", "attendance", "", "", "", " (เสนอชื่อถูก {a}%, ช่วงความเชื่อมั่น {b}–{c}%)",
