    "lensiq-claims-rules.js", "", "_platform", "", "", "", "anti-infection wording (kill / inhibit / prevent … virus, germ, infection; ZH 抑菌 / 抗病毒 / 天然抗生素), efficacy rates (ถึง 90 %), comparison with medicines, superlatives ('the best defence', 'perfect protector', No. 1, 之首 / 克星), 'all kinds of', remedy / treat / fight-off claims for anxiety / depression / seizures / chronic pain, ZH speed and 'no relapse / no side effects' wording",
