    "docs/ONE-PAGER-GATE.md", "", "gate", "", "", "", "| Real photos, top box on the plate | 44% (14 / 32) | n = 32 photos with a plate | public dataset (Wikimedia Commons), labels v3 confirmed by the owner 2026-11-12 | `docs/GATE.md` §3c |",
    "docs/ONE-PAGER-GATE.md", "", "gate", "", "", "", "| Real photos, exact automatic read | 32% (7 / 22); 27% (7 / 26) counting the 4 \"unsure letters\" photos as misses | n = 22 (12 of them used for tuning, so optimistic) | public dataset (Wikimedia Commons), labels v3 confirmed by the owner 2026-11-12 | `docs/GATE.md` §3c |",
    "docs/ONE-PAGER-GATE.md", "", "gate", "", "", "", "| Real photos, taps needed | 78% (25 / 32) | n = 32 | public dataset (Wikimedia Commons), labels v3 confirmed by the owner 2026-11-12 | `docs/GATE.md` §3c |",
    "docs/ONE-PAGER-GATE.md", "", "gate", "", "", "", "| Real photos without a plate read automatically | 0 / 19 (3 / 19 before the check; 95% interval 0–17%; held-out half 0 / 8, 0–32%) | n = 19 | public dataset (Wikimedia Commons), labels v3 confirmed by the owner 2026-11-12 | `docs/GATE.md` §3c |",
    "docs/ONE-PAGER-GATE.md", "", "gate", "", "", "", "| Owner's ~100 phone photos | not measured | — | field (owner photos): not measured | `docs/field-pilot/plates-photo-labels.md` |",
