    "docs/sales/DECK-ATTENDANCE.md", "", "attendance", "", "", "", "are included; no wage, tax or social-security calculation, no cloud sync, no rotating rosters. Measured (face option only; PIN / QR has no recognition error): Asian faces recognised per scan 66–76%",
    "docs/sales/DECK-ATTENDANCE.md", "", "attendance", "", "", "", "(n = 500 people x 5 photos, public dataset CASIA-FaceV5, held out but not perfectly blind, `ACCURACY.md` §2); strangers checked in with no confirmation at most 0.03% (n about 12,000 visits per row, public dataset).",
