    "docs/ONE-PAGER-EXAM.md", "", "exam", "", "", "", "| AI-only proctoring caught instructed cheaters (University of Twente trial with Proctorio) | 0 of 6 | — | published research (not a LENSIQ measurement) | `docs/EXAM.md` |",
