    "docs/sales/DEMO-SCRIPT-CROWD.md", "", "crowd", "", "", "", "**Prepare:** open https://anirut77.github.io/lensiq/crowd.html in current Chrome or Edge (demo mode, simulated, no camera) and `camera-notice.html` (sign A). Keep a screenshot of the \"figures and sources\"",
